@title Metroid Fusion (USA)
@file Metroid Fusion (U) [!].gba
@game AMTE
@chip SRAM
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba
# File A, A taps through the story; from the docking bay left, up the
# hydraulic-press shaft (spin jumps, ledge grabs), Main Deck, Navigation Room
# briefing; Quarantine Bay (kill the Hornoad, absorb the X); back up and to
# the Navigation Room for the second briefing; then the ladder room's grate
# column up to the first Save Room (Yes, "Save complete.").
# nba draws Samus's run/spin animation a frame off and its camera scrolls a
# few pixels differently in the press shaft and the grate column; mgba and
# nba saves are identical, dingbat-bios's save differs in 3 bytes (0x214,
# 0x218 checksum, 0x2E7 = 4 vs 7, the play-time frame counter).

